## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3.8 Live
- **Short description:** Google DeepMind’s native speech-to-speech model for the Gemini Live API with audio/image/video input and synthesized speech/text output (per local metadata).
- **Provider / access:** Google AI Studio / Gemini API (Live). Local metadata lists `google/gemini-3-8-live`, session context 131K/65K out, and text/audio pricing tiers.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not clearly established from accessible official sources in this pass. Knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `gemini-3.8-live`, `google/gemini-3-8-live`.
- **Context window:** 131K per session / 65K output (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, audio input; text and audio output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Free via AI Studio unpaid quota (per metadata); paid text $0.75/$4.50, audio $3/$12 per 1M.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary native speech-to-speech/realtime multimodal model. Architecture details not publicly disclosed.

